# Offline optB88-vdW pin notes — gpw-optb88-vdw

## Functional

CP2K (Hutter recipe, 2019 cp2k-user list):

```
&XC_FUNCTIONAL
  &LIBXC
    FUNCTIONAL XC_GGA_X_OPTB88_VDW
  &END LIBXC
  &PW92
  &END PW92
&END XC_FUNCTIONAL
&vdW_POTENTIAL
  DISPERSION_FUNCTIONAL NON_LOCAL
  &NON_LOCAL
    TYPE DRSLL
  &END NON_LOCAL
&END vdW_POTENTIAL
```

libxc exchange parameters (GGA_X_OPTB88_VDW id 139):

- β = 0.003368671161034469
- γ = 6.981317007977318

ATV: `XcKind::OptB88VdW` + `GpwDft::vdw_df = true`.

## Geometry

Same water dimer as `gpw-vdw-df-ice` / `gpw-rvv10-ice` (12 Å cell,
DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH, GTH-PBE, CUTOFF 200 Ry).

